atom_style      atomic
atom_modify map array sort 0 2.0
units           metal
newton          on
read_restart       final_npt.restart
pair_style mliap unified /checkpoints/cueq-0.8.mliap.pt 0
pair_coeff * * C C C H

mass      1      12.010999996910238
mass      2      12.010999996910238
mass      3      12.010999996910238
mass      4      1.0079999997406976

region          sub block 10.719 37.719 3.339 34.339 7.584 34.584 units box
group           keep region sub
group           drop subtract all keep
delete_atoms    group drop
change_box      all x final 9.219 39.219 y final 1.839 35.839 z final 6.084 36.084

neighbor        0.5 bin
neigh_modify    delay 50 every 2 check yes

thermo_style    custom step temp density vol press ke pe etotal spcpu
thermo_modify   flush yes
thermo          50
timestep        0.001

velocity        all create 533.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix             fMOM all momentum 100 linear 1 1 1 angular
fix             nve all nve
run             500
